q q .423529 .478431 .501961 rg BT/F4+0 8 Tf 59.53 46.8 TD (August 2026)Tj ET .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 8.5 Tf 546.9705 46.8 TD (8)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 617.6 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 96.4 TD (For most enterprises, that is the wrong answer. Building an internal AI capability that matches what a)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (foundation model lab provides requires an order of investment that is rarely justifiable for any single)Tj T* (enterprise. The talent is scarce, the infrastructure is expensive, the iteration speed is slower than what)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (specialist labs can sustain, and the gap between an internal model and a frontier model widens every)Tj T* (quarter as the labs keep pushing the capability frontier. Eli Lilly building a $200 million purpose-built)Tj T* (supercomputer for pharmaceutical AI is the exception, not the model. For most companies, doing this)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (internally either underdelivers on capability, overdelivers on cost, or both.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 578.1 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 20.4 TD (What enterprises actually need is not their own foundation model. They need their existing AI consumption)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (to produce more value per token. That is a different problem, and a different category of solution.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 546 cm .078431 .094118 .105882 rg BT/F2+0 11.6 Tf 0 2.9 TD (The spectrum of cost-discipline practices)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 492.7 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 35.6 TD (It would be a mistake to suggest enterprises are doing nothing to discipline their AI spend. A real spectrum)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (of practices is emerging, each producing measurable savings. The honest question is not whether these)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (practices work. They do. The question is where each one's structural ceiling sits.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 422.8 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 10 Tf 0 50.8 TD (Prompt optimization)Tj/F4+0 10 Tf ( tightens individual invocations: shorter system prompts, better examples, more)Tj -.117143 Tw 0 -15.200001 TD (disciplined context. Specialist teams can pull meaningful savings out of production workflows this way. The)Tj 0 Tw T* (ceiling, however, is set by the architecture beneath it. Better prompts make each call more efficient; they)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (do not change the underlying division of work between structured logic and the LLM.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 337.7 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 10 Tf 0 66 TD (AI FinOps and consumption monitoring)Tj/F4+0 10 Tf ( extend cloud FinOps practice into AI workloads: showback and)Tj -.099286 Tw 0 -15.200001 TD (chargeback, anomaly detection on token spend, budget allocation by workflow or team. This is governance)Tj 0 Tw T* (value, and it is real. But FinOps measures consumption; it does not change per-workflow economics. A)Tj T* (FinOps team can tell a CFO that a customer-service workflow costs $12 per run. It cannot make that)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (workflow cost $2.40 per run without an architectural change beneath it.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 252.6 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 10 Tf 0 66 TD (Model routing and caching)Tj/F4+0 10 Tf ( sit between prompt optimization and deeper architectural change. Sending)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (simpler queries to cheaper models, caching responses to repeated questions, batching where latency)Tj T* (permits: all of this produces meaningful savings on the right workloads. The ceiling here is the agentic)Tj T* (consumption multiplier. A workflow that loops through ten model invocations to complete a task still loops)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (through ten invocations, whichever model answers each one.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 137.1 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 10 Tf 0 96.4 TD (Deterministic AI Infrastructure)Tj/F4+0 10 Tf ( sits at the architectural end of this spectrum. It is not a replacement for)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (prompt optimization, FinOps, or routing; mature enterprise AI practice will use all of them. What DAII adds)Tj T* (is a structural change to what the LLM is asked to do in the first place. Where workflows have stable)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (structure, the predictable cognitive work is encoded in deterministic code, and the LLM is invoked where)Tj T* (its judgment adds value beyond what structured logic provides. The cost gap between DAII and the)Tj T* (operational disciplines is not incremental; it compounds, because the architecture attacks the)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (consumption pattern itself rather than optimizing each call within it.)Tj ET Q Q
