q q .423529 .478431 .501961 rg BT/F4+0 8 Tf 59.53 46.8 TD (August 2026)Tj ET .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 8.5 Tf 543.5705 46.8 TD (12)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 711 cm .078431 .094118 .105882 rg BT/F3+0 11 Tf 0 2 TD (3.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 685.5 cm .062745 .078431 .090196 rg BT/F2+0 20.5 Tf 0 4 TD (Deterministic AI Infrastructure)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 676.8 cm .866667 .890196 .894118 RG 1 J .7 w n 0 0 m 492.94 0 l S Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 644.7 cm .078431 .094118 .105882 rg BT/F2+0 11.6 Tf 0 2.9 TD (Defining the category)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 561 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 66 TD (Deterministic AI Infrastructure is the engineering discipline of making AI workflows produce consistent,)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (predictable, high-quality outputs at substantially lower token cost than naive prompt engineering achieves.)Tj T* (The discipline rests on a single architectural principle: structured logic handles what structured logic)Tj T* (handles reliably, large language models handle what calls for their judgment, and the work is divided)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (accordingly.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 445.5 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 96.4 TD (A naive AI workflow asks the LLM to do everything: reason about the data, compute the answer, structure)Tj -.102941 Tw 0 -15.199997 TD (the response, and write up the result in natural language. Each of those four functions costs tokens. Where)Tj 0 Tw T* (the workflow has stable, repeatable structure, three of them \(reasoning, computation, and structure\) can)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (often be done deterministically in code, with the answer fixed before the LLM is invoked. The LLM is then)Tj T* (asked to articulate, which is a job it is genuinely well suited to. Where the workflow is genuinely)Tj T* (open-ended, or the structure has not yet stabilized, that decomposition will not fit, and the LLM-led)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (architecture remains the right one. DAII is the discipline of recognizing which is which.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 314.8 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 111.6 TD (It is worth being explicit about what this paper is not arguing. The argument is not that generative AI or)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (agentic AI should be avoided, or that reasoning workloads belong outside AI systems. Plenty of legitimate)Tj T* (enterprise work calls for genuinely open-ended reasoning, and frontier models will be the right tool for it.)Tj T* (The argument is narrower: at production scale, for workflows with stable structure, undisciplined LLM)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (invocation produces cost and quality variance that disciplined architecture meaningfully reduces. The)Tj T* (discipline applies whether the workflow is linguistic, agentic, or reasoning-heavy. The question is not)Tj T* (whether AI should be used. The question is whether the use is economically governable at the scale)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (enterprises now deploy it.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 244.9 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 50.8 TD (The architectural pattern, separating deterministic logic from LLM-handled work, has antecedents in)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (compound AI systems, structured outputs, AI workflows, and validation pipelines. What is new is the)Tj T* (packaging: the consolidation of these patterns into a procurement-recognizable infrastructure tier defined)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (by cost-per-decision economics rather than by any single technical primitive.)Tj ET Q Q
