q q .423529 .478431 .501961 rg BT/F4+0 8 Tf 59.53 46.8 TD (August 2026)Tj ET .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F2+0 8.5 Tf 543.4005 46.8 TD (15)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 617.6 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 96.4 TD (This is a different and more dangerous failure mode than LLM hallucination. A naive LLM workflow that)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (hallucinates may at least reveal instability through variance across runs; the variance itself is a signal that)Tj T* (something may be off, and a domain expert reviewing two or three outputs can usually spot the)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (inconsistency. A deterministic system encoding incorrect domain logic can be wrong consistently, silently,)Tj T* (and at scale. The same flawed answer gets produced reliably across every workflow, looks credible)Tj T* (because the architecture around it is sound, and only fails the moment a domain expert audits the)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (underlying rules, which usually happens long after decisions have been made on the strength of its output.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 471.7 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 126.8 TD (There is a tempting counter to this concern: developers can use LLMs to fill their domain knowledge gaps)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (when building the structured layer. LLMs can legitimately assist in drafting code, taxonomies, and rules.)Tj T* (The problem is what happens next. If the code's logic is derived from LLM output without independent)Tj T* (validation by domain experts, the deterministic layer is deterministic only in execution, not in epistemic)Tj T* (authority. The same flawed reasoning will produce the same flawed answer reliably, with the appearance)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (of engineered rigor and the substance of LLM reasoning, and with worse traceability than either. The)Tj T* (LLM-as-knowledge-source approach is valid for narrow or well-documented domains. In any domain)Tj T* (where practical expertise matters, it requires a domain expert in the loop to validate the rules before they)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (are encoded. There is no shortcut.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 401.8 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 50.8 TD (DAII done well is therefore a meaningfully different kind of organization than a prompt-engineering shop or)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (a general AI consultancy. It requires both engineering depth and lived subject-matter depth, and the)Tj T* (integration of the two is itself a form of craft. It is harder to staff, harder to imitate, and a substantially)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (stronger moat than engineering competence alone.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 369.7 cm .078431 .094118 .105882 rg BT/F2+0 11.6 Tf 0 2.9 TD (How the architecture changes the economics)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 270.8 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 81.2 TD (Consider, as an illustrative example, a hospital deploying an AI workflow to surface operational patterns)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (from internal data. A naive implementation passes the data to a foundation model with a system prompt)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (and asks it to identify issues, prioritize them, write recommendations, and produce a report. That workflow)Tj T* (may consume 8,000 to 15,000 output tokens per run. At enterprise volumes, this scales into meaningful)Tj T* (monthly bills, with output quality varying significantly across runs, because the LLM is doing both the)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (analysis and the writing at the same time.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 140.1 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 111.6 TD (The same hospital, working with a DAII provider, would receive the same operational read produced)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (through a different architecture. A structured diagnostic engine, built on the provider's proprietary logic,)Tj T* (performs the analysis offline. The output is a canonical descriptor of findings, severities, priorities, and)Tj T* (recommended actions. The LLM is then invoked to produce a sector-aware narrative drawing on the)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (structured findings. Token consumption drops from roughly 12,000 to 2,400 tokens per run, the eighty)Tj T* (percent reduction shown in Figure 5. Output quality is more consistent, because the structured layer)Tj T* (anchors the report's substantive content. Per-run cost becomes a known engineering constant the)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (provider can quote in advance.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 59.53 70.2 cm .137255 .156863 .172549 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 0 50.8 TD (The token numbers here are illustrative, not measured from a specific deployment. The naive figure)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (assumes a workflow that delivers raw operational data to a frontier model with a prompt asking it to)Tj -.115 Tw T* (perform reasoning \(roughly 3,500 tokens\), perform computation across the data \(roughly 3,000\), structure)Tj 0 Tw 0 -15.2 TD (the response into a report shape \(roughly 2,500\), and write the narrative \(roughly 3,000\): totals consistent)Tj ET Q Q
