 (This pricing model has a property that pure foundation model APIs cannot match: the customer's)Tj 0 -15.199997 TD (per-decision cost is predictable. A hospital can quote a cost-per-diagnostic to its CFO and have it remain)Tj 0 -15.200001 TD (accurate over time, even as foundation model pricing changes underneath. The SaaS provider absorbs the)Tj T* (volatility in exchange for the engineering investment it has made in disciplined consumption. The value to)Tj T* (the customer is not token reduction alone. It is lower variance, stronger validation, domain-correct logic,)Tj 0 -15.2 TD (and reduced exposure to foundation-pricing volatility.)Tj ET Q Q
